  AF --> AR
  AR --> FN[OneLake and Fabric preparation]
  FN --> DB[Databricks pinned campaigns]
  DB --> RE[Versioned results and reports]
  RE --> BI[Power BI or Streamlit comparison]
  EV --> RT[Real-time lab app]
  O -.-> AL[Operational telemetry and bounded labels]
  AF -.-> AL
  Q -.-> AL
  DB -.-> AL
  AL --> GR[Grafana Cloud and Alloy]
  RE -.->|optional approved summaries| NE[Existing Neon result index]
